     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs\"> </a><p>This case-insensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">reporting-population<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-reporting-population\"> </a></td><td>Reporting population</td><td>Population of the State or LGA covered by the quarterly report.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">new-dots-centres<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-new-dots-centres\"> </a></td><td>Newly established DOTS centres</td><td>Number of newly established DOTS centres during the reporting quarter.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">new-afb-microscopy-centres<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-new-afb-microscopy-centres\"> </a></td><td>Newly established AFB microscopy centres</td><td>Number of newly established AFB microscopy centres during the reporting quarter.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">dots-centres-beginning<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-dots-centres-beginning\"> </a></td><td>DOTS centres at beginning of quarter</td><td>Number of DOTS centres at the beginning of the reporting quarter.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">dots-centres-end<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-dots-centres-end\"> </a></td><td>DOTS centres at end of quarter</td><td>Number of DOTS centres at the end of the reporting quarter.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">dots-coverage<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-dots-coverage\"> </a></td><td>DOTS coverage per population</td><td>Population-to-DOTS-centre ratio at the end of the reporting quarter.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">microscopy-centres-beginning<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-microscopy-centres-beginning\"> </a></td><td>AFB microscopy centres at beginning of quarter</td><td>Number of AFB microscopy centres at the beginning of the reporting quarter.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">microscopy-centres-end<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-microscopy-centres-end\"> </a></td><td>AFB microscopy centres at end of quarter</td><td>Number of AFB microscopy centres at the end of the reporting quarter.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">microscopy-coverage<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-microscopy-coverage\"> </a></td><td>AFB microscopy coverage per population</td><td>Population-to-AFB-microscopy-centre ratio at the end of the reporting quarter.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">centre-type<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-centre-type\"> </a></td><td>Centre type</td><td>Type or ownership category of the newly established centre.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">public<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-public\"> </a></td><td>Public</td><td>Public centre.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">prison<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-prison\"> </a></td><td>Prison</td><td>Prison centre.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">private<a name=\"ng-tb-quarterly-centre-report-cs-private\"> </a></td><td>Private</td><td>Private centre.</td></tr></table></div>"
